### =====================================================================
### CR_Chat API - pruebas manuales
### Requiere la extensión "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) de VS Code.
### Ejecuta las peticiones en orden con "Send Request": los tokens e ids
### se toman automáticamente de las respuestas anteriores (# @name).
### Si ya registraste los usuarios, cambia los teléfonos/emails o ve directo al login.
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

@phoneA = 88880001
@passA = secreto123
@phoneB = 88880002
@passB = secreto456

@tokenA = {{loginA.response.body.token}}
@refreshA = {{loginA.response.body.tkRef}}
@tokenB = {{loginB.response.body.token}}


### =========================== AUTH ===================================

### Registrar usuario A -> 201 (409 si ya existe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Usuario A",
  "phone_number": "{{phoneA}}",
  "email": "usuario.a@test.com",
  "pass": "{{passA}}"
}

### Registrar usuario B -> 201 (necesario para tener un contacto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Usuario B",
  "phone_number": "{{phoneB}}",
  "email": "usuario.b@test.com",
  "pass": "{{passB}}"
}

### Registrar con email inválido -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "X",
  "phone_number": "88889999",
  "email": "no-es-email",
  "pass": "secreto123"
}

### Registrar sin campos -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Login A -> 200 (devuelve token y tkRef)
# @name loginA
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_number": "{{phoneA}}",
  "pass": "{{passA}}"
}

### Login B -> 200
# @name loginB
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_number": "{{phoneB}}",
  "pass": "{{passB}}"
}

### Login con contraseña incorrecta -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_number": "{{phoneA}}",
  "pass": "incorrecta"
}

### Renovar tokens -> 200 (repetirla con el mismo tkRef da 401 por la rotación;
### vuelve a ejecutar "Login A" para obtener uno nuevo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tkRef": "{{refreshA}}"
}


### =========================== USUARIO ================================

### Perfil propio -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/usr/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Sin token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/usr/profile

### Perfil de otro usuario -> 200 (404 si no existe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usr/profile/{{loginB.response.body.id_usr}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Actualizar perfil -> 200 (devuelve el perfil actualizado)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/usr/update
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profile_description": "Probando CR_Chat desde REST Client"
}

### Actualizar con teléfono de otro usuario -> 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/usr/update
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_number": "{{phoneB}}"
}


### =========================== CONTACTOS ==============================

### Crear contacto (A agrega a B) -> 201 (409 si ya existe)
# @name createContact
POST {{baseUrl}}/contact/create
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact_number": "{{phoneB}}",
  "contact_name": "Mi amigo B"
}

### Contacto con número no registrado -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/contact/create
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact_number": "00000000"
}

### Listar contactos (límite 10, página 1) -> 200
# @name loadContacts
GET {{baseUrl}}/contact/load/10/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Listar contactos con filtro -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/contact/load/10/1?contact_name=amigo
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Actualizar contacto -> 204
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contact/update
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_contact": {{loadContacts.response.body.$[0].id_contact}},
  "contact_name": "B (editado)"
}

### Actualizar contacto ajeno (B intenta editar el de A) -> 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contact/update
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_contact": {{loadContacts.response.body.$[0].id_contact}},
  "contact_name": "hack"
}


### =========================== CHATS ==================================

### Crear chat con el contacto -> 201 (409 si ya existe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/create
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_contact": {{loadContacts.response.body.$[0].id_contact}}
}

### Listar chats -> 200
# @name loadChats
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/load
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### =========================== MENSAJES ===============================

### Enviar mensaje -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/send
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_chat": {{loadChats.response.body.$[0].id_chat}},
  "text_content": "Hola B, ¿cómo estás?"
}

### Enviar a chat ajeno (B usa el chat de A) -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/send
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_chat": {{loadChats.response.body.$[0].id_chat}},
  "text_content": "no debería poder"
}

### Cargar mensajes del chat -> 200
# @name loadMessages
GET {{baseUrl}}/message/load/{{loadChats.response.body.$[0].id_chat}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Editar mensaje -> 204
PUT {{baseUrl}}/message/edit
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_message": {{loadMessages.response.body.$[0].id_message}},
  "new_text": "Hola B (editado)"
}

### Eliminar mensaje -> 204 (404 si se repite)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/message/delete/{{loadMessages.response.body.$[0].id_message}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### =========================== LIMPIEZA / CUENTA ======================

### Eliminar contacto -> 204 (404 si se repite)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contact/delete/{{loadContacts.response.body.$[0].id_contact}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Desactivar cuenta B con contraseña incorrecta -> 403
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/usr/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pass": "incorrecta"
}

### Desactivar cuenta B -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/usr/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pass": "{{passB}}"
}

### Reactivar cuenta B (pública, sin token) -> 204 (401 si no está desactivada)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reactivate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_number": "{{phoneB}}",
  "pass": "{{passB}}"
}

### Cerrar sesión A -> 204 (después el refresh token queda revocado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### =========================== ERRORES GENERALES ======================

### Ruta inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/no-existe
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Método no permitido -> 405
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/usr/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Preflight CORS -> 204
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
